      "value": "<h2>Drawing Deep</h2><p><em>You hold the Sentence open and let the meaning pour in.</em></p><hr /><h3>Rules</h3><p>While your <strong>Sentence</strong> stance is active, your maximum <strong>Clarity</strong> increases by <strong>3</strong> — but the open channel costs you <strong>+1 Noise per scene</strong> for as long as the stance is held.</p><p style=\"font-size:0.8rem;opacity:0.85;margin:0.5rem 0 0\"><strong>Requires:</strong> Cosmic Linguist</p><p style=\"font-size:0.74rem;opacity:0.7;margin:0.5rem 0 0\">⚙ Applies automatically while the Sentence stance is active: +3 Clarity max. (The +1 Noise/scene upkeep is tracked narratively.)</p>",
